  <div class="article-header">
    <h1>Bar Harbor, ME Dispensary Guide</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">The Meristem, 420 Mules & the Mount Desert Island cannabis market</p>
  </div>

  <p class="answer-capsule">Exact options near Bar Harbor, with license status checked against the OCP rosters: <strong>420 Mules</strong> — a registered medical caregiver serving MDI patients by delivery (no adult-use storefront license). <strong>The Meristem</strong> — Mount Desert Island's only licensed adult-use (21+) store, at 11 Seal Cove Rd in Southwest Harbor, about 12 mi / 20 min from Bar Harbor. <strong>Snare Creek Farms</strong> — a medical dispensary at 211 Bar Harbor Rd in Trenton, about 16 mi away on the drive from Ellsworth. All three sit within about 30 minutes of Acadia's Hulls Cove entrance. Bring government-issued photo ID for adult-use purchases; medical-only stores require an MMMP card. Confirm hours before visiting.</p>

